<title>DUBAI: Qatar's QGPC appoints new marketing director.</title>
<headline>Qatar's QGPC appoints new marketing director.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar General Petroleum Corp (QGPC) has named Jassim Naamah as acting director of marketing at the state oil firm, a Ministry of Energy and Industry circular obtained by Reuters showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Naamah replaces Ibrahim al-Mutawa who is on &quot;open leave&quot;, according to the circular.</p>
<p>The change at QGPC comes ahead of an expected government cabinet reshuffle including widespread changes at the country's energy ministry and the state oil firm.</p>
<p>-- Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
